  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Giving Tuesday: Fund 40,000 Meals before 2023 ends</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We are setting a challenge in 2023 to provide 40,000 school dinners through this one project. This will help us with other feeding programs to relive the pressure. We will not use this fund for anything else except fund food so we can feed our hungry children in Brazil, Costa Rica, Uganda, Zimbabwe, Kenya and South Africa. $1 is all it costs to feed a child for 1 day...  While other projects will fundraise to build sustainable veggie gardens and food sources this project is about giving a meal</narrative>
  </description>
